 "steps": [
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Cut the deboned thighs into <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"cm\" data-a=\"4\" data-b=\"5\" data-s=\"0\">4–5 cm</span> pieces.</li><li><b>Poke them all over</b> with a sharp fork or skewer — both sides — so the marinade gets in.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-1",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Cut and poke",
    "diagram": null,
    "how": [
     {
      "caption": "Poke every piece all over with a sharp fork — both sides — so the marinade gets in.",
      "src": "illustrations/karaage/1-how1.webp"
     }
    ],
    "illustration": null,
    "photo": null,
    "result": "illustrations/karaage/1.webp",
    "svg_fallback": null
   },
   "n": 1,
   "part": null,
   "part_id": null,
   "time": "~8 min",
   "time_html": "<span>~8 min</span>",
   "title": "Cut and poke",
   "uses_rows": [
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"500\">500 g</span>",
     "name_html": "Boneless chicken thighs, skin on"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Mix the marinade:<ul class=\"ing two-col\"><li>ginger, grated <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"10\">10 g</span><span class=\"qalt\"> (<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"2\" data-alt=\"1\">2 tsp</span>)</span></span></li><li>garlic, grated <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"count\" data-a=\"2\" data-f=\"clove|cloves\" data-n=\"1\">2 cloves</span></span></li><li>mirin <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"1\">1 tbsp</span></span></li><li>soy sauce <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"2\">2 tbsp</span></span></li><li>sake <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"1\">1 tbsp</span></span></li><li>ground pepper <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"0.25\">¼ tsp</span></span></li><li>oyster sauce <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"1\">1 tsp</span></span></li><li>brown sugar <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"1\">1 tsp</span></span></li></ul></li><li>Toss the chicken in it and marinate in the fridge.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-2",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Marinate",
    "diagram": null,
    "how": [
     {
      "caption": "Mix the marinade, then toss the chicken in it.",
      "src": "illustrations/karaage/2-how1.webp"
     }
    ],
    "illustration": null,
    "photo": null,
    "result": "illustrations/karaage/2.webp",
    "svg_fallback": null
   },
   "n": 2,
   "part": null,
   "part_id": null,
   "time": "30 min – overnight",
   "time_html": "<span>30 min – overnight</span>",
   "title": "Marinate",
   "uses_rows": []
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Pour off and discard the excess marinade.</li><li>Mix <b><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"1\" data-s=\"0\">1 tbsp</span> flour and <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"1\" data-s=\"0\">1 tbsp</span> tapioca starch</b> into the chicken until every piece has a tacky coat.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-3",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Pour off, then flour + starch",
    "diagram": null,
    "how": [
     {
      "caption": "Tilt the bowl and pour off the excess marinade, holding the chicken back.",
      "src": "illustrations/karaage/3-how1.webp"
     },
     {
      "caption": "Mix in 1 tbsp flour and 1 tbsp tapioca starch until every piece is tacky.",
      "src": "illustrations/karaage/3-how2.webp"
     }
    ],
    "illustration": null,
    "photo": null,
    "result": "illustrations/karaage/3.webp",
    "svg_fallback": null
   },
   "n": 3,
   "part": null,
   "part_id": null,
   "time": "~3 min",
   "time_html": "<span>~3 min</span>",
   "title": "Pour off, then flour + starch",
   "uses_rows": [
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"1\">1 tbsp</span>",
     "name_html": "Flour (into the chicken)"
    },
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"1\">1 tbsp</span>",
     "name_html": "Tapioca starch (into the chicken)"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Spread the tapioca starch over a cutting board.</li><li>Make the little round bits: drizzle a teaspoon or two of water (or leftover marinade) over part of it and work it with a fork into small crumbs and pebbles.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-4",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Starch board and crumbs",
    "diagram": null,
    "how": [
     {
      "caption": "Drizzle a little water over part of the starch and work it with a fork into small crumbs.",
